Error [E0112]: `apply` wants fn(Int) Int -[]> for argument 1, but this is fn(Int) Int -[IO]>
  --> tests/ui/lambda_interface_effect_mismatch.jet:4:17
    |
  4 |     print(apply((n: Int) Int -[IO]> n))
    |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Every argument must match its parameter's type
 Fix: Use fn(Int) Int -[]> here
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0112
